OL,3,GNEWSAAsda offices evacuated due to
OL,4,A'suspicious package'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsda's head office building has been
OL,7,Fevacuated after a "suspicious package"
OL,8,Fwas found there, police have said.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police received reports
OL,11,Fof the item having been sent to Asda
OL,12,FHouse, on Great Wilson Street in Leeds,
OL,13,Fat about 11:15 GMT on Monday.
OL,15,FEmergency services are currently at the
OL,16,Fscene, and an Army explosive ordnance
OL,17,Fdisposal team is also in attendance.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
