OL,3,GNEWSAAsda offices evacuated due to
OL,4,A'suspicious package'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said: "The building has been
OL,7,Fevacuated as a precaution and a cordon
OL,8,Fis in place." A spokesperson for Asda
OL,9,Fsaid everyone within the building had
OL,10,Fleft "safely".
